     /// Extra CA certificate bundle files (PEM) to trust for this registry:
-    /// one behind a private or in-cluster CA, which the compiled-in public
-    /// roots do not cover.
+    /// one behind a private or in-cluster CA, which neither the compiled-in
+    /// public roots nor the system trust store (including `SSL_CERT_FILE` and
